],"Theme.JSON Presets":["Theme.JSON el\u0151be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok"],"Background Type":["H\u00e1tt\u00e9r t\u00edpusa"],"About Background Types":["A h\u00e1tt\u00e9rt\u00edpusokr\u00f3l"],"(Current)":["(Aktu\u00e1lis)"],"Overlay Color":["Fed\u0151r\u00e9teg sz\u00edne"],"The chosen color must have some transparency for the background(s) beneath to be visible.":["A v\u00e1lasztott sz\u00ednnek valamennyire \u00e1tl\u00e1tsz\u00f3nak kell lennie, hogy az alatta l\u00e9v\u0151 h\u00e1tt\u00e9r(ek) l\u00e1that\u00f3(ak) legyen(ek)."],"About Background Overlay":["A h\u00e1tt\u00e9r\u00e1tfed\u00e9sr\u0151l"],"About Background Image":["A h\u00e1tt\u00e9rk\u00e9pr\u0151l"],"About Background Repeat":["A h\u00e1tt\u00e9r ism\u00e9tl\u00e9s\u00e9r\u0151l"],"The background-repeat CSS property sets how background images are repeated. A background image can be repeated along the horizontal and vertical axes, or not repeated at all.":["A background-repeat CSS tulajdons\u00e1g hat\u00e1rozza meg, hogyan ism\u00e9tl\u0151dnek a h\u00e1tt\u00e9rk\u00e9pek. A h\u00e1tt\u00e9rk\u00e9p ism\u00e9tl\u0151dhet v\u00edzszintes \u00e9s f\u00fcgg\u0151leges tengely ment\u00e9n, vagy egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem ism\u00e9tl\u0151dik."],"100px 50%, cover, contain, etc":["100px 50%, cover, contain, stb."],"About Background Attachment":["A h\u00e1tt\u00e9r r\u00f6gz\u00edt\u00e9s\u00e9r\u0151l"],"The background-attachment CSS property sets whether a background image's position is fixed within the viewport, or scrolls with its containing block.":["A background-attachment CSS tulajdons\u00e1g hat\u00e1rozza meg, hogy a h\u00e1tt\u00e9rk\u00e9p poz\u00edci\u00f3ja r\u00f6gz\u00edtett-e a n\u00e9zetablakon bel\u00fcl, vagy a tartalmaz\u00f3 blokkal egy\u00fctt g\u00f6rd\u00fcl."],"About Gradients":["A sz\u00edn\u00e1tmenetekr\u0151l"],"Cancel select preset":["El\u0151be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1s\u00e1nak megszak\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Select preset":["El\u0151be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1sa"],"Learn more about gradients.":["Tov\u00e1bbi tudnival\u00f3k a sz\u00edn\u00e1tmenetekr\u0151l."],"About Background Blend Mode":["A h\u00e1tt\u00e9r kever\u00e9si m\u00f3dj\u00e1r\u00f3l"],"The background-blend-mode CSS property sets how an element's background images should blend with each other and with the element's background color.":["A background-blend-mode CSS tulajdons\u00e1g hat\u00e1rozza meg, hogy egy elem h\u00e1tt\u00e9rk\u00e9pei hogyan keveredjenek egym\u00e1ssal \u00e9s az elem h\u00e1tt\u00e9rsz\u00edn\u00e9vel."],"Backgrounds":["H\u00e1tterek"],"Delete all background styles":["Az \u00f6sszes h\u00e1tt\u00e9rst\u00edlus t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"This will delete all background styles for the current selector. This operation cannot be undone.":["Ez t\u00f6rli az aktu\u00e1lis szelektor \u00f6sszes h\u00e1tt\u00e9rst\u00edlus\u00e1t. Ezt a m\u0171veletet nem lehet visszavonni."],"Learn more about Backgrounds":["Tov\u00e1bbi inform\u00e1ci\u00f3 a h\u00e1tterekr\u0151l"],"Remove the disabled background to enable.":["A bekapcsol\u00e1shoz t\u00e1vol\u00edtsa el a kikapcsolt h\u00e1tteret."],"Reorder Background":["H\u00e1tt\u00e9r \u00e1trendez\u00e9se"],"Empty":["\u00dcres"],"Learn more about this property":["Tov\u00e1bbi inform\u00e1ci\u00f3 err\u0151l a tulajdons\u00e1gr\u00f3l"],"About Background Clip":["A background-clip tulajdons\u00e1gr\u00f3l"],"This property only will apply if a background color or image is set, or if the element has a border with transparency.":["Ez a tulajdons\u00e1g csak akkor \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes\u00fcl, ha be van \u00e1ll\u00edtva h\u00e1tt\u00e9rsz\u00edn vagy -k\u00e9p, illetve ha az elemnek van \u00e1tl\u00e1tsz\u00f3 szeg\u00e9lye."],"About Background Origin":["A background-origin tulajdons\u00e1gr\u00f3l"],"This property property sets the background's origin: from the border start, inside the border, or inside the padding.":["Ez a tulajdons\u00e1g a h\u00e1tt\u00e9r eredet\u00e9t \u00e1ll\u00edtja be: a keret sz\u00e9l\u00e9t\u0151l, a kereten bel\u00fclr\u0151l vagy a paddingen bel\u00fclr\u0151l."],"Select a style":["V\u00e1lasszon st\u00edlust"],"Add via paste\u2026":["Hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1s beilleszt\u00e9ssel\u2026"],"Delete all box shadow styles":["Az \u00f6sszes box-shadow-st\u00edlus t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"This will delete all box shadow styles for the current selector. This operation cannot be undone.":["Ez t\u00f6rli az aktu\u00e1lis szelektor \u00f6sszes box-shadow-st\u00edlus\u00e1t. Ezt a m\u0171veletet nem lehet visszavonni."],"Learn more about CSS Box Shadows":["Tov\u00e1bbi tudnival\u00f3k a CSS-doboz\u00e1rny\u00e9kokr\u00f3l"],"Reorder Box Shadow":["Box-shadow \u00e1trendez\u00e9se"],"Invalid box shadow":["\u00c9rv\u00e9nytelen box-shadow"],"Error parsing pasted styles. Please check your CSS and try again.":["Hiba a beillesztett st\u00edlusok feldolgoz\u00e1sakor. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, ellen\u0151rizze a CSS-t, \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja meg \u00fajra."],"Invalid cubic-bezier definition.":["\u00c9rv\u00e9nytelen cubic-bezier defin\u00edci\u00f3."],"Invalid steps definition.":["\u00c9rv\u00e9nytelen steps defin\u00edci\u00f3."],"Unknown timing function.":["Ismeretlen id\u0151z\u00edt\u00e9si f\u00fcggv\u00e9ny."],"Enter any valid CSS timing function.":["Adjon meg b\u00e1rmilyen \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes CSS id\u0151z\u00edt\u00e9si f\u00fcggv\u00e9nyt."],"Please enter a valid CSS property!":["K\u00e9rj\u00fck, adjon meg \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes CSS-tulajdons\u00e1got!"],"Paste in transition styles":["\u00c1tmenetst\u00edlusok beilleszt\u00e9se"],"Delete all transition styles":["Az \u00f6sszes \u00e1tmenetst\u00edlus t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"This will delete all transition styles for the current selector. This operation cannot be undone.":["Ez t\u00f6rli az aktu\u00e1lis szelektor \u00f6sszes \u00e1tmenetst\u00edlus\u00e1t. Ezt a m\u0171veletet nem lehet visszavonni."],"Learn more about CSS Transitions":["Tov\u00e1bbi tudnival\u00f3k a CSS-\u00e1tmenetekr\u0151l"],"Reorder 