elete all transform styles for the current selector. This operation cannot be undone.":["Ez t\u00f6r\u00f6lni fogja az aktu\u00e1lis szelektor \u00f6sszes transzform\u00e1ci\u00f3s st\u00edlus\u00e1t. Ez a m\u0171velet nem vonhat\u00f3 vissza."],"Learn more about CSS Transforms":["Tov\u00e1bbi tudnival\u00f3k a CSS-transzform\u00e1ci\u00f3kr\u00f3l"],"Reorder Transform":["Transzform\u00e1ci\u00f3 \u00e1trendez\u00e9se"],"Learn more about transform origin":["Tov\u00e1bbi tudnival\u00f3k a transzform\u00e1ci\u00f3s orig\u00f3r\u00f3l"],"Using the \"hidden\" value may cause some block editor elements to become invisible.":["A \u201ehidden\u201d \u00e9rt\u00e9k haszn\u00e1lata a blokkszerkeszt\u0151 egyes elemeit l\u00e1thatatlann\u00e1 teheti."],"The URL of an image to be used as the list item marker.":["A listaelem jel\u00f6l\u0151jek\u00e9nt haszn\u00e1land\u00f3 k\u00e9p URL-c\u00edme."],"The position of the list item marker.":["A listaelem jel\u00f6l\u0151j\u00e9nek poz\u00edci\u00f3ja."],"List properties will not apply unless the element's display property is set to list-item":["A listatulajdons\u00e1gok nem \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes\u00fclnek, kiv\u00e9ve, ha az elem display tulajdons\u00e1ga list-item \u00e9rt\u00e9kre van \u00e1ll\u00edtva"],"More":["Tov\u00e1bbiak"],"The content property is used with the ::before and ::after pseudo-elements and must be wrapped in quotes.":["A content tulajdons\u00e1got a ::before \u00e9s ::after pszeudoelemekkel haszn\u00e1lj\u00e1k, \u00e9s id\u00e9z\u0151jelek k\u00f6z\u00e9 kell tenni."],"About Pointer Events":["A Pointer Eventsr\u0151l"],"Use this property to control whether an element can be the target for click\/keyboard events. See the documentation link below for a complete list (note: some only apply to SVG tags).":["Ezzel a tulajdons\u00e1ggal szab\u00e1lyozhatja, hogy egy elem lehet-e kattint\u00e1si vagy billenty\u0171zetes esem\u00e9nyek c\u00e9lpontja. A teljes list\u00e1t az al\u00e1bbi dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3s linken t